{
  "name": "Papierkram — create an invoice from a webhook",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "path": "papierkram-invoice",
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "responseMode": "lastNode",
        "responseData": "allEntries"
      },
      "id": "3f7a1b10-0001-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -220,
        0
      ],
      "webhookId": "3f7a1b10-0001-4000-8000-00000000000a"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "invoice",
        "operation": "create",
        "name": "={{ $json.subject }}",
        "lineItems": "={{ JSON.stringify($json.positions) }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "customerId": "={{ $json.customerId }}",
          "documentDate": "={{ $now.format('yyyy-MM-dd') }}",
          "paymentTermId": 1
        }
      },
      "id": "3f7a1b10-0001-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Create invoice",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-papierkram.papierkram",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "invoice",
        "operation": "pdf",
        "invoiceId": "={{ $json.id }}"
      },
      "id": "3f7a1b10-0001-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Fetch PDF",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-papierkram.papierkram",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Create an invoice\n\nThe webhook expects:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"subject\": \"Consulting, September\",\n  \"customerId\": 6,\n  \"positions\": [\n    { \"name\": \"Consulting\", \"quantity\": 8, \"unit\": \"Stunde\", \"price\": 120, \"vat_rate\": \"19%\" }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n**vat_rate is not a percentage.** It is the name of a tax rate as configured in the account, spelled exactly as Papierkram spells it — `19%`, or `0% Ohne USt (Kleinunternehmer)` for a small business. No endpoint lists the valid names; the easiest source is an existing invoice.\n\n**Document Date is required**, although the API documentation marks it optional.\n\nThe invoice is created as a draft and has no number yet. To send it, append *Invoice → Deliver*.",
        "height": 460,
        "width": 420
      },
      "id": "3f7a1b10-0001-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -220,
        160
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Webhook": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Create invoice",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Create invoice": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Fetch PDF",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "pinData": {}
}
